## A Universe Made Just for You

You are acting as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, product architect, Firebase security engineer, and creative experience designer.

Your task is to design and build a complete, immersive, private, personalized digital universe called **HIRA**.

This is not an ordinary website, a generic portfolio, a public social platform, or a standard romantic landing page.

